    meaning:"By remembering and naming Acyuta, deficiencies in tapas, worship, and ritual action become complete. The worshipper offers all actions of body, speech, mind, senses, intellect, and nature to N\u0101r\u0101ya\u1e47a and asks \u015ar\u012b Lak\u1e63m\u012b-N\u0101r\u0101ya\u1e47a to be pleased by the completed deva-p\u016bj\u0101.",
    action:"Recite the concluding verses of completion, deficiency-forgiveness, total surrender, ak\u1e63aya-karma reflection, V\u0101sudeva-pr\u012b\u1e47ana, and final samarpana. Offer the completed worship through the guru-line and inner deities to \u015ar\u012b Lak\u1e63m\u012b-N\u0101r\u0101ya\u1e47a. Conclude with \u015ar\u012b K\u1e5b\u1e63\u1e47\u0101rpa\u1e47am astu."
